{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"one-dark-pro-like","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"One Dark Classic","description":"A balanced dark theme with soft blues and greens.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"One Dark Classic","path":"themes/one-dark-pro-like.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/one-dark-pro-like.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"One Dark Classic\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#282c34\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#abb2bf\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#21252b\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#21252b\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#21252b\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#21252b\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#2c313a\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#3e4451\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#1d1f23\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#21252b\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#181a1f\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#528bff\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#528bff\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#528bff\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#3e4451\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#2c313a80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#528bff\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#181a1f\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#e06c75\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#98c379\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#e5c07b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#e06c75\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5c6370\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#98c379\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d19a66\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c678dd\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e5c07b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#61afef\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d19a66\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e06c75\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e06c75\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d19a66\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#56b6c2\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# One Dark Classic\n\nA balanced dark theme with soft blues and greens.\n\nInstall it, then pick **One Dark Classic** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Atom One Dark palette.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#282c34` |\n| Text | `#abb2bf` |\n| Accent | `#528bff` |\n| Keywords | `#c678dd` |\n| Strings | `#98c379` |\n| Functions | `#61afef` |\n| Types | `#e5c07b` |\n| Comments | `#5c6370` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}